<GuideLayout
  title="Fitclo vs. Trading Houses: Why Professional Buyers are Moving Directly to the Source"
  type="STRATEGY"
  description="An objective comparison for established brands: Why the factory-direct model beats the traditional trading company in the 2026 activewear market."
>
  <h2>The Evolution of B2B Sourcing</h2>
  <p>In the past, trading houses provided a "filter" between Western brands and Chinese factories. In 2026, for a mature brand with established standards, these intermediaries often become a barrier to profit and speed.</p>

  <img src="/images/migrated/third-party/hfacb2ef50051497481f5deeb487294f0j-8374e16cc4.webp" alt="Fitclo Factory-Direct Production: Cutting Out the Middleman" class="w-full rounded-2xl my-8 shadow-xl" />

  <h3>Comparing the Models</h3>
  <div class="overflow-x-auto my-8">
    <table class="w-full border-collapse border border-white/10 text-white/70">
      <thead>
        <tr class="bg-white/5">
          <th class="border border-white/10 p-4 text-left">Feature</th>
          <th class="border border-white/10 p-4 text-left">Trading House (Middleman)</th>
          <th class="border border-white/10 p-4 text-left">Fitclo (Direct Factory)</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td class="border border-white/10 p-4">Unit Pricing</td>
          <td class="border border-white/10 p-4">15-30% Markup</td>
          <td class="border border-white/10 p-4">True Factory-Direct</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="border border-white/10 p-4">Communication</td>
          <td class="border border-white/10 p-4">Filtered / Slower</td>
          <td class="border border-white/10 p-4">Direct with Engineers</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="border border-white/10 p-4">Trend Access</td>
          <td class="border border-white/10 p-4">Lagging Styles</td>
          <td class="border border-white/10 p-4">Weekly R&D Drops</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="border border-white/10 p-4">Customization</td>
          <td class="border border-white/10 p-4">Limited / outsourced</td>
          <td class="border border-white/10 p-4">Integrated In-House</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h3>Direct Control Over Your Brand Identity</h3>
  <p>When you work with a middleman, you lose control over where your labels and tags are sourced. At Fitclo, we handle all branding in our 16,000㎡ facility. This ensures that your monogram logo and your high-waist sculpting leggings are engineered together for a perfect finish.</p>

  <img src="/images/migrated/third-party/he70e1aafb8294b84a3c6f1b1b7b247f6s-309d2e130c.webp" alt="Fitclo Integrated Customization: From Fabric to Final Packing" class="w-full rounded-2xl my-8 shadow-xl" />

  <h3>The Advantage of Factory Speed</h3>
  <p>Mature sellers like those on <em>XMYoohoo</em> need to move fast. By cutting out the 3-5 days of "agent back-and-forth," professional brands can launch new collections and restock best-sellers 20% faster, giving them a significant edge in competitive markets like the USA and UK.</p>
</GuideLayout>
